sequenceDiagram
    participant SpringBoot as Spring Boot
    participant ConfigFile as Configuration File
    participant DSProps as DataSourceProperties
    participant DSBuilder as DataSourceBuilder
    participant DS as DataSource

    SpringBoot->>ConfigFile: load properties with prefix tenants
    Note right of ConfigFile: Reads application.yml or application.properties
    ConfigFile-->>DSProps: property values loaded
    Note right of DSProps: Map[String, Object] Tenant configuration properties

    SpringBoot->>DSProps: invoke setDatasources method
    Note right of DSProps: datasources: Map[String, Map[String, String]] tenant configurations

    activate DSProps
    DSProps->>DSProps: forEach iterate over each tenant configuration
    Note right of DSProps: Process each tenant entry

    loop For each tenant
        DSProps->>DSProps: call convert method for each tenant datasource
        Note right of DSProps: tenantName: String (tenant identifier) config: Map[String, String] (datasource configuration)

        DSProps->>DSBuilder: create DataSource instance
        activate DSBuilder
        DSBuilder-->>DSProps: DataSource
        Note right of DSBuilder: Configured datasource for tenant
        deactivate DSBuilder

        DSProps->>DSProps: store datasource in datasources map
        Note right of DSProps: key: String (tenant name) value: DataSource (datasource instance)
    end

    deactivate DSProps
